Subject: [PATCH] REDO: payload update to support multiple repos

Replaces the single Y2JB payload update with a flexible repo-based updater. Adds src/repo_manager.py to handle updating payloads from multiple sources as defined in a config file. Updates the server endpoint and frontend logic to use the new update mechanism, and updates the UI to call the new function.
